WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:21.863
"That frog was huge!" said Terrell.

2
00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:25.245
"Where did it come from?" asked Mara.

3
00:00:25.246 --> 00:00:28.033
"I don't know," said Jack.

4
00:00:28.034 --> 00:00:30.075
Roxy didn't say anything.

5
00:00:30.076 --> 00:00:33.304
She had to turn into Rocket Girl and go downtown.

6
00:00:33.305 --> 00:00:35.844
But she couldn't let her friends see her.

7
00:00:35.845 --> 00:00:38.073
Roxy thought for a moment.

8
00:00:38.074 --> 00:00:42.012
Then she had an idea.

9
00:00:42.013 --> 00:00:46.884
"Aah!" Roxy screamed as she pretended to spot another frog.

10
00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:52.617
"A giant frog! Run for your lives."

11
00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:55.455
Then she disappeared into the woods.

12
00:00:55.456 --> 00:00:59.318
"Hmm," thought Terrell, looking around.

13
00:00:59.319 --> 00:01:07.192
"That's odd. I don't see any other giant frogs."

14
00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:14.564
When Roxy landed downtown, she saw giant, slimy frogs everywhere.

15
00:01:14.565 --> 00:01:18.027
Three of them hopped down West Street.

16
00:01:18.028 --> 00:01:20.605
They left a trail of wet footprints.

17
00:01:20.606 --> 00:01:25.347
Other frogs clung to the sides of buildings, making horrible croaking sounds.

18
00:01:25.348 --> 00:01:27.077
Roxy felt sick.

19
00:01:27.078 --> 00:01:29.710
"Ugh." She groaned.

20
00:01:29.711 --> 00:01:33.841
"Why couldn't the city be invaded by giant squirrels?

21
00:01:33.842 --> 00:01:36.168
Squirrels are cute."

22
00:01:36.169 --> 00:01:41.881
"Rocket Girl!" shouted Detective Smith.

23
00:01:41.882 --> 00:01:43.980
"I'm glad you're here!"

24
00:01:43.981 --> 00:01:48.301
"Uh, hi, Detective," she mumbled.

25
00:01:48.302 --> 00:01:50.837
Detective Smith looked surprised.

26
00:01:50.838 --> 00:01:52.501
"Are you okay?

27
00:01:52.502 --> 00:01:54.758
Aren't you going to make a joke?"

28
00:01:54.759 --> 00:01:59.616
A frog landed on a nearby car. Skrunch!

29
00:01:59.617 --> 00:02:05.706
"I'm not really in a joking mood," said Roxy weakly.

30
00:02:05.707 --> 00:02:12.317
Another frog knocked over a streetlamp. Ribbit! Ribbit!

31
00:02:12.318 --> 00:02:15.606
"This is terrible," said Detective Smith.

32
00:02:15.607 --> 00:02:19.202
"We need to find out how these frogs got so—"

33
00:02:19.203 --> 00:02:23.432
"Rocket Girl! Save me!" a voice screamed.

34
00:02:23.433 --> 00:02:25.287
Roxy looked up.

35
00:02:25.288 --> 00:02:28.734
Halfway up a building was a frog with a car in its mouth.

36
00:02:28.735 --> 00:02:31.155
The driver was still inside.

37
00:02:31.156 --> 00:02:33.904
"Oh no!" cried Roxy.

38
00:02:33.905 --> 00:02:38.116
It didn't matter that Roxy was scared of frogs.

39
00:02:38.117 --> 00:02:42.015
She was Rocket Girl, and Metro City needed her help!

40
00:02:42.016 --> 00:02:44.423
She flew as fast as she could.

41
00:02:44.424 --> 00:02:47.614
Ribbit! A frog leaped in front of Roxy.

42
00:02:47.615 --> 00:02:50.559
She swooped over it.

43
00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.139
"These frogs are everywhere!" said Roxy.

44
00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:57.878
Down on the street, someone screamed. "Look out!"

45
00:02:57.879 --> 00:03:01.420
A fat frog had knocked over the big bear statue.

46
00:03:01.421 --> 00:03:04.639
The statue was about to fall on a group of people.

47
00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.934
Roxy flew down and caught it.

48
00:03:06.935 --> 00:03:12.781
She placed the statue back on its platform.

49
00:03:12.782 --> 00:03:15.473
Roxy shot toward the frog with the car.

50
00:03:15.474 --> 00:03:18.801
When the frog saw Roxy, it flicked its tongue at her.

51
00:03:18.802 --> 00:03:24.153
Thwap! The car fell out of the frog's mouth.

52
00:03:24.154 --> 00:03:26.647
"Whoa!" cried Roxy.

53
00:03:26.648 --> 00:03:30.242
Roxy dived fast. Zoom!

54
00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:34.080
She caught the car just before it hit the street.

55
00:03:34.081 --> 00:03:37.372
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!" said the driver.

56
00:03:37.373 --> 00:03:41.020
"No problem," said Roxy. "I'm glad I could—"

57
00:03:41.021 --> 00:03:43.261
Thwap!

58
00:03:43.262 --> 00:03:50.314
"Agh!" Roxy screamed.
